## Claw Command - psionic traits (psionics port)

trait-category-psionic = Psionics

trait-latent-psychic-name = Latent Psychic
trait-latent-psychic-desc = Your mind brushes against the noosphere. You have no powers yet, but the potential is there — over the shift you may spontaneously manifest one. Be aware that psionic activity raises station glimmer, and that Epistemics is entitled to mindbreak rogue psions.

trait-anomalous-positronics-name = Anomalous Positronics
trait-anomalous-positronics-desc = Your positronic brain was built with a flaw, or perhaps a gift. The insulation that normally seals synthetic minds off from the noosphere is absent, leaving you as exposed to psionics as any organic — for better and for worse.

trait-high-potential-name = High Potential
trait-high-potential-desc = Your mind reaches for the noosphere more eagerly than most. You are substantially more likely to manifest new psionic powers over the course of a shift.

trait-low-potential-name = Low Potential
trait-low-potential-desc = The noosphere is slow to answer you. You are substantially less likely to manifest new psionic powers over the course of a shift.

trait-high-amplification-name = High Amplification
trait-high-amplification-desc = Your powers land harder than they should. Everything you do is stronger, and everything you do is louder to anyone listening.

trait-low-amplification-name = Low Amplification
trait-low-amplification-desc = Your powers are faint things. What you do is weaker, but it also draws less attention.

trait-power-overwhelming-name = Power Overwhelming
trait-power-overwhelming-desc = Raw, unreasonable strength, and not one shred of control to go with it. Your powers hit like a truck and are impossible to hide.

trait-high-dampening-name = High Dampening
trait-high-dampening-desc = You have learned to keep a lid on it. Your powers are precise, controlled, and quieter than they have any right to be.

trait-low-dampening-name = Low Dampening
trait-low-dampening-desc = Control was never your strong suit. Your powers spill out messily and are easy for others to detect.

trait-natural-telepath-name = Natural Telepath
trait-natural-telepath-desc = You can speak mind to mind with other psions, and hear them in turn. Use the Telepathic chat channel, or prefix a message with '='.

trait-dispel-power-name = Dispel
trait-dispel-power-desc = You can unmake the summoned and the immaterial with a thought — guardians, familiars, revenants and the like.

trait-metapsionic-power-name = Metapsionic Pulse
trait-metapsionic-power-desc = You can sweep the area around you for psionic signatures, and you feel it whenever a power is used nearby.

trait-psychognomy-power-name = Psychognomy
trait-psychognomy-power-desc = When you hear a telepathic voice, you perceive an impression of the speaker rather than plain words — a descriptor, never a name.

trait-healing-word-power-name = Healing Word
trait-healing-word-power-desc = A word from you knits flesh back together. You can heal others at range, and with effort pull them back from death.

trait-psionic-regeneration-power-name = Psionic Regeneration
trait-psionic-regeneration-power-desc = You can flood your own bloodstream with a regenerative essence drawn from the noosphere, mending your wounds over time.
